        {
          "field": "stem",
          "before": null,
          "after": "If a polynomial \\(f(x)\\) is divisible by \\(x-k\\), then \\(f(3x)\\) is divisible by which expression?"
        },
        {
          "field": "stemZh",
          "before": null,
          "after": "若多項式 \\(f(x)\\) 可被 \\(x-k\\) 整除，則 \\(f(3x)\\) 可被下列哪式整除？"
        },
        {
          "field": "solution",
          "before": null,
          "after": "Let \\(g(x)=f(3x)\\). As \\(f(k)=0\\), \\(g(k/3)=0\\). By the factor theorem, \\(x-\\frac{k}{3}\\) is a factor."
        },
        {
          "field": "solutionZh",
          "before": null,
          "after": "設 \\(g(x)=f(3x)\\)。由 \\(f(k)=0\\)，得 \\(g(k/3)=0\\)，故 \\(x-\\frac{k}{3}\\) 是因式。"
        },
        {
          "field": "solutionStatus",
          "before": null,
          "after": "independently-rederived"
        },
