        {
          "field": "stem",
          "before": null,
          "after": "Find the L.C.M. of \\(x^2-6\\), \\((x-3)(x+2)\\) and \\((x^2-12x+36)(x-3)\\)."
        },
        {
          "field": "stemZh",
          "before": null,
          "after": "求 \\(x^2-6\\)、\\((x-3)(x+2)\\) 及 \\((x^2-12x+36)(x-3)\\) 的最小公倍式。"
        },
        {
          "field": "solution",
          "before": null,
          "after": "Factor the last expression as \\((x-6)^2(x-3)\\). Include each distinct factor at its greatest power. None of \\(x-3,x+2,x-6\\) divides \\(x^2-6\\), so the L.C.M. is \\[\\begin{gathered}(x-3) \\cdot(x+2) \\\\ \\cdot(x^2-6) \\\\ \\cdot(x-6)^2\\end{gathered}\\]."
        },
        {
          "field": "solutionZh",
          "before": null,
          "after": "最後一式為 \\((x-6)^2(x-3)\\)。各相異因式取最高次冪；\\(x-3,x+2,x-6\\) 均不是 \\(x^2-6\\) 的因式，故最小公倍式為 \\[\\begin{gathered}(x-3) \\cdot(x+2) \\\\ \\cdot(x^2-6) \\\\ \\cdot(x-6)^2\\end{gathered}\\]。"
        },
        {
          "field": "solutionStatus",
          "before": null,
          "after": "independently-rederived"
        },
