        {
          "field": "stem",
          "before": null,
          "after": "Let \\[\\begin{gathered}f(x) =x^{2014} +ax \\\\ +b\\end{gathered}\\], where \\(a,b\\) are constants. The remainder when \\(f(x)\\) is divided by \\(x+1\\) is 3. Find \\(2a-2b+1\\)."
        },
        {
          "field": "stemZh",
          "before": null,
          "after": "設 \\[\\begin{gathered}f(x) =x^{2014} +ax \\\\ +b\\end{gathered}\\]，其中 \\(a,b\\) 為常數。\\(f(x)\\) 被 \\(x+1\\) 除的餘式為 3，求 \\(2a-2b+1\\)。"
        },
        {
          "field": "solution",
          "before": null,
          "after": "From \\(f(-1)=3\\), \\(1-a+b=3\\), so \\(a-b=-2\\). Thus \\[\\begin{gathered}2a -2b +1 =2(-2) +1 \\\\ = -3\\end{gathered}\\]."
        },
        {
          "field": "solutionZh",
          "before": null,
          "after": "由 \\(f(-1)=3\\)，得 \\(1-a+b=3\\)，故 \\(a-b=-2\\)。所以 \\[\\begin{gathered}2a -2b +1 =2(-2) +1 \\\\ = -3\\end{gathered}\\]。"
        },
        {
          "field": "solutionStatus",
