        {
          "field": "stem",
          "before": null,
          "after": "Let \\(f(x)=ax^2+bx+c\\). If \\(f(x+1)-f(x)\\) is divisible by \\(2x+1\\), find \\(b\\)."
        },
        {
          "field": "stemZh",
          "before": null,
          "after": "設 \\(f(x)=ax^2+bx+c\\)。若 \\(f(x+1)-f(x)\\) 可被 \\(2x+1\\) 整除，求 \\(b\\)。"
        },
        {
          "field": "solution",
          "before": null,
          "after": "Expansion gives \\[\\begin{gathered}f(x+1) -f(x) \\\\ =a(2x+1) +b\\end{gathered}\\]. Its remainder on division by \\(2x+1\\) is \\(b\\), hence \\(b=0\\)."
        },
        {
          "field": "solutionZh",
          "before": null,
          "after": "展開得 \\[\\begin{gathered}f(x+1) -f(x) \\\\ =a(2x+1) +b\\end{gathered}\\]，故除以 \\(2x+1\\) 的餘式為 \\(b\\)。可整除表示 \\(b=0\\)。"
        },
        {
          "field": "solutionStatus",
          "before": null,
          "after": "independently-rederived"
