        {
          "field": "stem",
          "before": null,
          "after": "The H.C.F. and L.C.M. of three expressions are \\(6xz\\) and \\(108x^3y^2z^2\\) respectively. The first two expressions are \\(54x^3yz\\) and \\(18x^2y^2z\\). Which is the third expression?"
        },
        {
          "field": "stemZh",
          "before": null,
          "after": "三式的最大公因式及最小公倍式分別為 \\(6xz\\) 及 \\(108x^3y^2z^2\\)。首兩式為 \\(54x^3yz\\) 及 \\(18x^2y^2z\\)，第三式是哪個？"
        },
        {
          "field": "solution",
          "before": null,
          "after": "For A, the coefficient gcd is 6 and lcm is 108; minimum variable exponents give \\(xz\\) and maxima give \\(x^3y^2z^2\\). B has coefficient lcm 216; C leaves at least \\(x^2\\) in the H.C.F.; D leaves coefficient 18. Thus only A meets both conditions."
        },
        {
          "field": "solutionZh",
          "before": null,
          "after": "選 A 時，係數的最大公因數為 6、最小公倍數為 108；變量最低指數給 \\(xz\\)，最高指數給 \\(x^3y^2z^2\\)。B 的係數最小公倍數為 216；C 的最大公因式含 \\(x^2\\)；D 的公因數係數為 18，均不符。"
        },
        {
          "field": "solutionStatus",
          "before": null,
          "after": "independently-rederived"
        },
        {
          "field": "source",
          "before": null,
          "after": "S4/more about polynomials/S4 polynomials review.pdf · Q7"
